        "original_id": "577f4e53-2de2-575e-b0e8-a5568e7e4183",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Dobkin, Alfred Gough, Miles Millar, Jackie Chan, Owen Wilson, Ben Stiller, Tom Wu, David Frankel, Howard Franklin, Jack Black, Steve Martin\n- Films: Shanghai Knights, Revolver, Batman Begins, Ra.One, The Big Year, Cars\n- Topics: Frat Pack comedies, voice acting, martial arts\n\nFacts:\n- Shanghai Knights was directed by David Dobkin, written by Alfred Gough and Miles Millar, and starred Jackie Chan and Owen Wilson.\n- Owen Wilson starred with Ben Stiller in numerous films.\n- Owen Wilson is known for roles in Frat Pack comedies and for voicing Lightning McQueen in the Cars franchise.\n- Tom Wu is a martial arts expert who appeared in Revolver, Shanghai Knights, Batman Begins, and Ra.One.\n- The Big Year is a 2011 American comedy film directed by David Frankel, written by Howard Franklin, and starring Jack Black, Steve Martin, and Owen Wilson.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
